#X text 2400 2300 Four object boxes \, not one message box: in a message box \$1 and \$2 would be the incoming message's atoms \, not the creation arguments., f 58;
#X text 1150 1460 The reconnect: under 0.49 a UDP connect with nothing listening survived one datagram \, then dropped every send in silence. Under 0.57 the socket survives a refusal (Reference \, pure-data) \, so the retry is for a connect that never came up: the spigot starts open and closes on success \, since reconnecting an open socket prints an error. No warning: a lost phone is reported by the phone's own NO-LINK (Brendan \, 2026-11-03)., f 70;
