#X text 1400 1960 The slow repeat \, for a phone that arrives late: the last parameter and status go again every 2 s (item 121)., f 70;
#X text 2800 1900 Banging an empty store is safe: it sends /cutit/param with no arguments \, which the phone's list split 1 drops. The status store starts with a dash because its branch has no such guard., f 58;
